| Test | Expected |
|------|----------|
| Rapid plug/unplug | No crash, no orphaned clients |
| 3 monitors, remove middle | Clients redistribute correctly |
| DPMS all monitors off then on | All clients preserved |
| Resolution change on active monitor | Clients re-tile correctly |
| TV on during fullscreen app | Fullscreen stays on Dell |
| Rotated monitor (90°) | Correct geometry and tiling |

---

### Phase 3: Multi-monitor polish

Goal: Handle advanced configurations.

#### Step 3.1: Output position configuration from Lua

Allow `screen.x` and `screen.y` properties to set output position:

```lua
