        s.y = 0
    end
end)
```

#### Step 3.2: Remember output configuration

Store last known good configuration per output (by name/EDID).
When output reconnects, restore its previous position and settings.

#### Step 3.3: Rotation support

Verify that rotated outputs (90°/270°) get correct geometry in `updatemons()`.
The workarea width/height swap needs to be handled in `arrangelayers()` and
`luaA_screen_update_geometry()`.

#### Step 3.4: Output power management from Lua

Expose DPMS control through Lua API:

```lua
screen[2].dpms = false  -- Turn off second monitor
screen[2].dpms = true   -- Turn it back on
```

