1600-/* Set the keyboard layout group.
1601- *
1602: * Strategy: use wlr_keyboard_notify_modifiers() on member keyboards.
1603- * This is the same path wlroots uses internally for grp:alt_shift_toggle.
1604- * It properly updates the member's xkb_state, syncs modifiers, and
1605- * propagates through handle_keyboard_modifiers() to the group keyboard,
1606- * which then reaches somewm's keypressmod() and the client.
1607- *
1608: * Previous approach (manual xkb_state_update_mask + struct patching)
1609- * failed because wlr_keyboard_notify_key() on the member would later
