|------|-------------------|---------------------|
| **1. Event source** | `axisnotify()` | `axisnotify()` |
| **2. Hit-test** | `xytonode()` → drawin found | `xytonode()` → no drawin (root) |
| **3. Button code** | Linux code → translate_button_code() → X11 (4 or 5) | Same |
| **4. Stage 1** | `emit_drawable_button_signal()` on drawable | None |
| **5. Stage 2** | `drawin_emit_button_signals()` with masked_mods=`mods&0xFF` | `luaA_root_button_check()` with full mods |
| **6. Modifier check** | `btn->modifiers==BUTTON_MODIFIER_ANY OR btn->modifiers==masked_mods` | `btn->modifiers==0 OR btn->modifiers==mods` |
